      "spam": false,
      "value": "Not exactly expecting this to pass.  Nor would I see most players who do 'misgender' will even heed it.\n\nIt is upsetting when I am still called \"he\" or \"him\" even though my avatar is clearly female... and my voice apparently still sounds masculine, or even sounds like a younger male... which despite my efforts, I have not been able to fix, without having to use a voice changer (which many would pick up on anyways.)\n\neither way.. I'll still upvote.",
      "viewerReactions": null
    }
