  "companyID": "58c62e995865713647a7115d",
  "created": "2018-01-11T18:10:38.269Z",
  "deletedAt": null,
  "details": "Hello, I think you should have the discord server set up so that people can self-assign user roles that are non-functional except for adding \"he/him,\" \"she/her,\" or \"they/them,\" to the users window when their name is clicked. This makes it easier to communicate with people properly, and not misgender people. Thank you.",
